Modifications: absolute package imports, workflow canvas selection, independent
reference-image sizing (including disabled second vision resize), FP32 latent accumulation, CFG below one, and configurable
lossless cache storage. Other project modules implement configuration, cache
management, file selection, metrics, logging and tests for the supplied workflow.

No ComfyUI code modules are bundled or imported. The supplied workflow JSON is
included as the user's reference input. External weights, reference images and
libraries are subject to their respective licenses.
